Greenpower Receiver Agent - Setup\par
\par
This installs a small background app that watches for the Greenpower LoRa receiver over USB and forwards telemetry to the live dashboard. It asks for your permission (a Windows notification) every time before forwarding anything - nothing goes live silently.\par
\par
Before you continue:\par
\par
- Requires Node.js (LTS) already installed - https://nodejs.org\par
- Requires an internet connection during setup (installs a few small dependencies)\par
- No admin rights needed - this installs to your own user folder and registers itself to start automatically only for your account\par
\par
After setup finishes, day-to-day use is just: plug in the receiver, click Yes on the notification. Nothing else to run.\par
